<rml>
<head>
	<title>Command Window</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="docked_panel_frame.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="command_window.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
	<!-- Modern theme's own copy of command_window.rml: the forged-dialog shell and the modern exit
	     button of docked_panel_frame.rcss's family instead of the frame sprites. Keep ids,
	     data-model and event names in sync with ../../command_window.rml.

	     The command window (CCommandWindow, D): twelve buttons that arm a command for the next
	     right-click on a player, docked right. the workspace slot places and scales #panel
	     (UI::Scaling::GetActiveTransform()), as party_info.rml's #panel does; everything inside is
	     reference px. Text is a .sharp-text layer: native size, counter-scaled out of the panel.

	     C++ keeps the armed command (`selected`, drawn pressed and bold), the right-click that runs
	     it, Escape; a button click is queued with command_press. The
	     target box follows the pointer while a command is armed over a player. -->
	<div id="panel" data-model="command_window">
		<div class="modern-shell-edge"></div>
		<div class="modern-groove"></div>
		<div class="modern-header-rail-px docked-header-rail-fill">
			<div class="modern-joint-px"></div>
			<div class="docked-rail-accent"></div>
		</div>

		<span class="sharp-text" id="title" data-style-font-size="title_text_px + 'px'"
		      data-style-line-height="title_line_px + 'px'">{{title_text}}</span>

		<div id="buttons">
			<div class="cmd-btn" data-for="b : buttons" data-class-selected="b.selected"
			     data-event-click="command_press(b.index)">
				<span class="sharp-text sharp-middle cmd-label"
				      data-style-font-size="b.label_text_px + 'px'" data-style-line-height="b.label_line_px + 'px'">{{b.label}}</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div id="btn_exit" class="modern-icon-btn-px cmd-btn-exit" data-event-click="command_exit" data-attr-data-hint="exit_tooltip">
			<span class="modern-icon-btn-glyph-px">&#215;</span>
		</div>

		<div id="target" data-if="target_visible" data-class-out-of-range="!target_in_range"
		     data-style-left="target_left + 'px'" data-style-top="target_top + 'px'">
			<span class="sharp-text" id="target_name" data-style-font-size="big_text_px + 'px'">{{target_name}}</span>
		</div>
		<div id="frame_corner_close" data-event-click="command_exit"></div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
